@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginAdv

# Scene2-3-2

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐3‐2
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:那天晚餐过后，<br>受到艾玛、雪莉还有汉娜的召集，<br>我们聚在会客室。|#0203Adv02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅、诺亚、亚里沙、米莉亚、安安，还有我，<br>一同站在她们的面前。|#0203Adv02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……抱歉，突然把你们喊出来。<br>我跟雪莉还有汉娜商量过了。|#0203Adv02_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:我们是不是，<br>应该再好好想想怎样逃出这里比较好。|#0203Adv02_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:没错，就这样一直呆下去，<br>我们的魔女化程度也只会一天比一天严重。|#0203Adv02_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:也许会发生凶杀案，<br>只要有人被杀，就会有人在审判中被处决。|#0203Adv02_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经受够了，<br>我不要再过这种日子……！|#0203Adv02_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:所以啊！<br>我们联合起来，一起想出一个超厉害的越狱计划吧！|#0203Adv02_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:与兴奋地说出这番话的三人相反，<br>包括我在内，每个人都是一副提不起兴致的样子。|#0203Adv02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……要怎样才能离开这里？|#0203Adv02_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_05,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『你们这是想再次连累我们吗？』|#0203Adv02_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……|#0203Adv02_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:随着安安举起的素描本，<br>一众少女的视线自然而然地往入口附近看去。|#0203Adv02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0203Adv02_Jailer001| AuthorId:Jailer RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守正站在门口。|#0203Adv02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:本以为上次处刑时，看守已经和奈叶香一起被冰封起来了。<br>可到了第二天，看守依然四处巡查，仿佛什么事情都没发生过。|#0203Adv02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（看守仍旧是被洗脑的状态）|#0203Adv02_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我甚至都开始觉得，<br>　那场处刑是典狱长以自己的低级趣味想出来的，<br>　某种表演的一环）|#0203Adv02_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（要是看守那时的行为是自发做出的就好了）<br>|#0203Adv02_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:心如刀割的深切苦痛。<br>心里被大石头堵住的憋闷感。<br>一想起奈叶香受处刑时的情景，这些感受总会向我袭来。|#0203Adv02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我强行把这些情绪塞进心底，<br>向前踏出一步。|#0203Adv02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:安安说得没错。<br>只要有看守在，我们就要冒着巨大风险越狱。|#0203Adv02_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每个人各自去寻找越狱方法或者逃走的暗道等，都没问题。<br>但在没有确切方法的情况下，就不应该所有人一起冲。|#0203Adv02_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:对。我也同意。<br>我认为现在还是乖乖服从他们为好。<br>起码在表面上要摆出服从的态度。|#0203Adv02_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:谁不想尽快离开这种地方啊。<br>只是一直以来，我也已经尝试过各种方法，最后全都失败了。|#0203Adv02_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:要是想到什么好方法，就给我快说。|#0203Adv02_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:你说得、有道理……对不起。|#0203Adv02_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不需要道歉呀！<br>我们就用我们自己的方式，<br>去寻找逃出现状的方法吧。|#0203Adv02_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我说，大家不要想不开啊……！|#0203Adv02_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可被杀，奈叶香被处决……<br>少女们的心比之前动摇得更加剧烈。|#0203Adv02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我很犹豫，<br>不知道该不该把奈叶香提供的情报都告诉其他人。|#0203Adv02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:比如大魔女的存在这件事。以及——<br>只要解除名为“魔女化”的诅咒，<br>也许就能得救这件事。|#0203Adv02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可这一切都还停留在【不确定】的阶段，<br>　仅仅只是给大家带来有名无实的希望，这是错误的）|#0203Adv02_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且还有可能会掀起另一场风波。|#0203Adv02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（关于大魔女的事，果然还是应该由我一人独自调查）|#0203Adv02_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我可以说一句吗。我是这样想的。|#0203Adv02_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在我刚在心中得出结论时，<br>一直沉思不语的蕾雅抬起头说道。|#0203Adv02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:身为管理者的梅露露都死了，<br>为什么我们还得举行审判不可？|#0203Adv02_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:监牢里发生的第一起凶杀案。<br>死者不是别人，正是梅露露。|#0203Adv02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管如此，典狱长还是把我们召集起来，<br>举行了审判。|#0203Adv02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_05,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『不是为了报仇吗？』|#0203Adv02_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:原来是这样。既然梅露露是管理者，<br>也就是说她是典狱长的上司对吧。|#0203Adv02_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊，那说不定典狱长确实很想揪出凶手。|#0203Adv02_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:那只鸟看起来没那么仗义就是了。|#0203Adv02_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我也这么觉得。|#0203Adv02_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:对于报仇这个推测，亚里沙和汉娜都持怀疑的态度。|#0203Adv02_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……我们先假设第一次审判是这个原因。<br>那第二次审判呢？|#0203Adv02_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们应该没有必要举行审判才对吧？<br>只要没了审判的心理压力，<br>这里的生活应该能变得轻松很多，不是吗？|#0203Adv02_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:你说得也有道理。<br>真希望不要再举行审判……不理解为什么非得一直坚持举行<br>这么残忍的事情。|#0203Adv02_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露死了以后，<br>典狱长依然若无其事地照常推进审判。<br>监牢的生活也没有任何变化。|#0203Adv02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定典狱长它自己也有什么想法呢。<br>|#0203Adv02_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……啧，别在这里说这些有的没的，<br>直接去问那只鸟不是更快？|#0203Adv02_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我立刻举起了手。|#0203Adv02_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:关于这件事，我想说几句。|#0203Adv02_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也对此感到很疑惑，<br>早就质问过典狱长了。|#0203Adv02_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ========================================
; ◎回想シーン（新規）
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000FF Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:18_1

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:有一次，我偶然遇到典狱长在我眼前飞过，<br>就把它给抓住了。|#0203Adv02_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了让它跑不掉，我用尽全身力气把它紧抓着提了起来。|#0203Adv02_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.10

[PrintTextModified Text:……真是太粗鲁了。突然抓住我干嘛呢？<br>我可是禁止触摸的鸟。|#0203Adv02_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经逐渐习惯<br>典狱长这种故意惹人不快的言行。<br>我冷眼看着它，淡淡地说道。|#0203Adv02_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我有事想再问问你。|#0203Adv02_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你说过，这座监牢的管理者是梅露露对吧。|#0203Adv02_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不管是杀人还是审判，全都是她在背后一手操纵的。<br>……是这么一回事对吧？|#0203Adv02_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0203Adv02_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长沉默了。<br>我不理会它的反应，继续问下去。|#0203Adv02_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然梅露露死了，<br>继续审判我们应该已经没有意义了才对。|#0203Adv02_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还是说……你有继续下去的理由？<br>有不得不继承梅露露遗志的理由？|#0203Adv02_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我不知道你在说什么。<br>我只是听命代为管理这里而已。|#0203Adv02_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要有人死了，就举行魔女审判。<br>一旦查出犯下杀人罪行的魔女，就将其处死……|#0203Adv02_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算梅露露大人死了，<br>这座监牢的运作系统也不会变更的。|#0203Adv02_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不管梅露露活着还是死了，都一样。|#0203Adv02_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女会杀人。<br>魔女会受到杀人冲动的驱使，夺去他人的性命。|#0203Adv02_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们这群少女依然是充满危险的存在，这个前提没有改变。<br>……它说的就是这个意思吧。|#0203Adv02_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说实话，变更这个那个，都是很麻烦的……<br>不过，没有立刻把你们全都扑杀，<br>你们就该谢天谢地了吧？|#0203Adv02_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
