; ========================================
; 回想ここまで
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:结果还是一切照旧……|#0203Adv02_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜这句低语，让气氛变得凝重。|#0203Adv02_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry

[PrintTextModified Text:大家听我说，我们不能放弃希望！|#0203Adv02_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就像要撕裂这沉重的氛围一般，<br>蕾雅大声说道。|#0203Adv02_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我们确实依然是囚徒之身……<br>被杀死或是被处刑，这些危险都时刻伴随着我们。|#0203Adv02_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可这一切也许都要看我们自己怎么行动。<br>让我们坚强起来，做一些力所能及的事吧！|#0203Adv02_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了鼓舞在场的人，<br>蕾雅用铿锵有力的声音说道。|#0203Adv02_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（力所能及的事，吗。<br>　我要想办法把大魔女……）|#0203Adv02_Hiro015|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们首先要做的，就是——|#0203Adv02_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:通力合作，打造一场精彩的舞台剧！|#0203Adv02_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——蕾雅满脸笑容，坚定地说道。|#0203Adv02_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:哈？|#0203Adv02_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_18_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_18_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯？怎么啦？|#0203Adv02_Leia011| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不由自主地发出反问。<br>蕾雅却用充满期待的眼光疑惑地看着我。|#0203Adv02_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:不是吧，你还打算做下去？|#0203Adv02_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:那是当然。汉娜不也已经<br>为我们做了好几件漂亮的戏服了嘛。<br>我可不打算浪费哦。|#0203Adv02_Leia012| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对笑眯眯的蕾雅，<br>汉娜红着脸移开了视线。|#0203Adv02_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed

[PrintTextModified Text:哼、哼……！<br>这么明显的奉承，<br>人家才不会高兴呢！|#0203Adv02_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:可你刚才稍微嘴角上翘了一下对吧？|#0203Adv02_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:才没有！|#0203Adv02_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在不知不觉间，<br>凝重的气氛变得稍微轻快了些。|#0203Adv02_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1
@Wait WaitMode:0.1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:AnAn

[PrintTextModified Text:剧本……我跟米莉亚已经写出来了一部分。|#0203Adv02_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安递给蕾雅一沓纸片。|#0203Adv02_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:噢噢，安安，米莉亚，谢谢你们！|#0203Adv02_Leia013| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我只是随便看了一下内容而已啦～。|#0203Adv02_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一众少女一改刚才阴郁的心情，<br>开始热烈地讨论起舞台剧的事情。|#0203Adv02_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa

[PrintTextModified Text:其中也有拒绝参与这个话题的人。|#0203Adv02_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哼……随你们便。|#0203Adv02_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙转身走出了房间。|#0203Adv02_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:至于我——我没有离开。我的心里充满了犹豫。|#0203Adv02_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:（我必须优先调查大魔女的事情）|#0203Adv02_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但蕾雅说的没错，<br>　构建稳固的信赖关系也很重要……）|#0203Adv02_Hiro018|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:之前蕾雅之所以会提议制作舞台剧，<br>就是为了加深各位少女之间的感情。|#0203Adv02_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:互相了解，培养对彼此的好感。<br>这样说不定就能遏制凶杀案发生。|#0203Adv02_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（蕾雅的提案是正确的。<br>　为了哪怕是减少一点点凶案发生的可能性，<br>　也要考虑她的提案）|#0203Adv02_Hiro019|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们全都是受害者。|#0203Adv02_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且她们仍然有着变成魔女的危险。<br>谁都不知道会在什么时候、<br>因为什么契机，导致凶杀案发生。|#0203Adv02_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——既然如此，每个人都应该得到正确的救赎。|#0203Adv02_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使其中包括我厌恶的人。|#0203Adv02_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我悄悄看向艾玛。|#0203Adv02_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0203Adv02_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛提议越狱，被其他人否决，<br>现在依然显得有点泄气。|#0203Adv02_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我对艾玛的负面感情<br>　并没有消失）|#0203Adv02_Hiro020|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可就算我再怎么厌恶她，<br>　她同样也是受害者之一）|#0203Adv02_Hiro021|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我甚至曾经计划杀死艾玛，<br>但现在这股冲动已经按捺下来。|#0203Adv02_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且……在上一次审判里跟艾玛发生过冲突后，<br>我的情感也发生了些许动摇。|#0203Adv02_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我心中的艾玛，到底是真正的她吗？|#0203Adv02_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（竟然会觉得迷茫，这一点都不像平常的我）|#0203Adv02_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:我说，蕾雅。<br>诺亚也很期待舞台剧。|#0203Adv02_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然，能画出很多很多画，诺亚也很开心哦？<br>不过，大家演戏的样子，也想赶快看到呢。|#0203Adv02_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听到诺亚的声音，我下定了决心。|#0203Adv02_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:曾经，我决心跟其他人保持距离。<br>可是——|#0203Adv02_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我也试着主动接近别人吧）|#0203Adv02_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……蕾雅，我能插一句吗。|#0203Adv02_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚跟蕾雅在开心地说着话。<br>我走到她们身边说道。|#0203Adv02_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:关于舞台剧的制作，<br>能不能也让我搭把手。|#0203Adv02_Hiro025| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅的脸上闪过一阵<br>错愕的神色。|#0203Adv02_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:真……|#0203Adv02_Leia014| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:45 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:真的吗，希罗！？|#0203Adv02_Leia015| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅兴奋地双手抓住我的肩膀。|#0203Adv02_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:用不着这么惊讶吧？<br>还有，脸凑太近了。|#0203Adv02_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不不，这可太令人惊讶了……<br>应该说，这提议太让我高兴了！|#0203Adv02_Leia016| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊，简直好极了！|#0203Adv02_Leia017| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无视我摆出的冷漠态度，<br>蕾雅夸张地表达着自己的喜悦。<br>那喜形于色的样子，仿佛马上就要高歌一曲。|#0203Adv02_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……所以，我该做些什么呢。|#0203Adv02_Hiro027| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我想想啊……|#0203Adv02_Leia018| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅托着下巴，直勾勾地盯着我看。|#0203Adv02_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
