@ModifyCamera Offset:,4 Zoom:0.5 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCamera Offset:,-3 Duration:2 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:2
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她把我从头顶到脚尖都仔仔细细<br>观察了一通。|#0203Adv02_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:？|#0203Adv02_Hiro028| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:以希罗的外貌，<br>只当个后台工作人员实在浪费。|#0203Adv02_Leia019| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:请你务必跟我一同站上舞台！|#0203Adv02_Leia020| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……请容我拒绝。|#0203Adv02_Hiro029| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia

[PrintTextModified Text:你站在舞台上的身姿……<br>我想，这绝对会是一个动人的画面。|#0203Adv02_Leia021| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来蕾雅没有听到<br>我刚才说的话。|#0203Adv02_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:到底哪个角色适合希罗呢……|#0203Adv02_Leia022| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:要不把小仙子这个角色增加到两个，怎么样！？|#0203Adv02_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:不错哦！不过，<br>下血本安排一个原创的反派角色也挺……|#0203Adv02_Leia023| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:这样不行，那样不好。<br>蕾雅她们几个快乐地交谈着。|#0203Adv02_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……但我从没说过要上台表演）|#0203Adv02_Hiro030| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我实在拿她们没有办法，只能叹气。<br>但我也因此找回了些许笑容。|#0203Adv02_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

